0. SUMMARY  (a convenience only; if it differs from sections 1-10, those govern)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  YES   Play the game at will, for free, in a web browser from the pages provided here.
  YES   Read everything, clone it, keep copies, and share unmodified copies free of charge (with this license).
  YES   PRINT the rules, the cards and the 3D models (for example on a 3D printer) and play the game on a real table.
  YES   Make changes, house rules, and new content (including DLCs / expansions) and publish them free of charge — under THIS license.
  YES   Help: ideas, bug reports, balance feedback, pull requests. Contributions are welcome.
  NO    Sell it, or make money from it, in any form: not the game, not printed copies, not printed models or cards, not DLCs, not
        a service built on it. Selling or otherwise commercially distributing ANYTHING covered by this license is not allowed.
