        wrappers, launchers or store listings (the Author plans official versions).
  THE AUTHOR alone holds the right to publish the game, and anything built on it, commercially — in print, on tabletop, and
        digitally on any platform. DLCs and contributions stay free and under this license, but the Author owns the commercial
        publishing rights to them (section 5).

